<section class="lifecycle-notice" id="native-eol" aria-labelledby="native-eol-title">
  <div>
    <p class="eyebrow"><i></i> Native A/B and nbc lifecycle</p>
    <h2 id="native-eol-title">Move to bootc<br />before September 30.</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="notice-copy">
    <p>Native A/B images and systems installed with <code>nbc</code> reach end of support and routine publication on <strong>September 30, 2026</strong>. After that date Frostyard publishes no routine fixes, security updates, dependency refreshes, native images, or nbc packages for those systems.</p>
    <p>There is no in-place conversion. Verify a readable backup, then reinstall with a bootc image for continued support.</p>
    <div>
      <a href="https://github.com/frostyard/snosi/blob/main/docs/adr/0015-retire-native-ab-images-and-nbc-installs.md">Read the accepted decision ↗</a>
